@host = http://localhost:8080
@conversationId = paste-conversation-id-here
@proposedActionId = paste-proposed-action-id-here

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Create conversation
POST {{host}}/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hospital visit"
}

### Submit transcript
POST {{host}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/transcripts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-transcript-001

{
  "speaker": "HearingUser",
  "originalText": "Ngay mai luc 8 gio toi co lich kham o benh vien Cho Ray, hay nhac toi truoc 30 phut.",
  "language": "vi",
  "startedAt": "2026-07-11T10:00:00+07:00",
  "endedAt": "2026-07-11T10:00:05+07:00",
  "sequenceNumber": 1
}

### List proposed actions
GET {{host}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/proposed-actions

### Confirm proposed action
POST {{host}}/api/proposed-actions/{{proposedActionId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hospital appointment",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-07-12T08:00:00+07:00",
  "location": "Cho Ray Hospital",
  "recipientEmail": "user@example.com"
}

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/today
